    "answer": {
      "short": "$6378\\text{ km}$",
      "worked": "The distance from the surface to the centre is the radius. Divide both sides by $2\\pi$.\n$$\\begin{align*}C &= 2\\pi r\\\\40075 &= 2\\pi r\\\\\\frac{40075}{2\\pi} &= r\\\\r &\\approx 6378\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
